WEBVTT

00:02.295 --> 00:04.635
shinjitai
I want to believe

00:04.735 --> 00:07.795
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light that I found that day

00:08.275 --> 00:11.005
kimi to kawashita
Because I still have

00:11.005 --> 00:15.675
tatta hitotsuno yakusoku ga arukara
That one promise that I made to you

00:16.075 --> 00:23.075
mou tachidomarazuni aruite yukitai
I want to keep walking, never stopping

00:24.785 --> 00:27.655
Dragon Drive

00:27.655 --> 00:33.185
uresugita kajitsu wo kajiru youni
Like biting into an overripe fruit

00:33.295 --> 00:36.265
yowai jibun ni
I was spoiling myself

00:36.265 --> 00:39.535
amaetsuzukete ita
I was giving in to my weakness

00:40.005 --> 00:44.375
kimi ni deawanakereba
If I hadn't met you

00:44.375 --> 00:46.345
ima mo
I'd still...

00:46.345 --> 00:52.675
kabe wo kowasu koto nado dekinakatta yo
...be unable to break the walls around me

00:54.385 --> 00:56.755
wasurenai
I'll never forget

00:56.755 --> 00:59.985
ano hi kanjita itami
The pain that I felt that day

01:00.285 --> 01:05.295
nido to ano basho modoritakunai
I never want to go back to that place

01:05.295 --> 01:06.885
motto tsuyoku
This strong feeling

01:06.995 --> 01:09.395
shinjitai
I want to believe

01:09.395 --> 01:12.565
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light I found that day

01:12.935 --> 01:18.005
kakkowarui to warawaretemo ii
Let them laugh and call me a loser

01:18.005 --> 01:20.745
bukiyou dakara
Because I'm clumsy

01:20.745 --> 01:28.445
onaji ikikata shika erabenainda
I can only choose to live life this way

01:40.995 --> 01:43.225
I was hoping to see it again, but...

01:48.275 --> 01:48.925
Daisuke!

01:52.105 --> 01:53.195
B-But why?

01:53.775 --> 01:55.835
I vowed I'd never press the reset button!

01:55.975 --> 01:57.575
Show us that you're a man!

02:10.095 --> 02:12.455
That wasn't one of Kanper's attacks.

02:17.165 --> 02:20.325
Shocking Awakening

02:23.305 --> 02:25.135
Sea Palace

02:59.045 --> 03:00.605
Look. There.

03:00.605 --> 03:01.675
Miss Sayaka.

03:01.675 --> 03:03.015
It's Miss Sayaka.

03:03.015 --> 03:05.535
To meet the real Miss Sayaka, in person...

03:06.615 --> 03:11.815
Miss Sayaka... If there's anything that
I can do for you, p-please let me help.

03:12.185 --> 03:13.555
My, how delightful!

03:13.555 --> 03:15.755
Then would you please entertain me?

03:17.125 --> 03:18.795
Well...

03:18.795 --> 03:20.455
You're simply too slow.

03:23.265 --> 03:25.095
M-My glasses!

03:25.205 --> 03:27.135
I'm afraid you need more training.

03:28.235 --> 03:29.675
Now, please get out of my way.

03:30.435 --> 03:33.435
Miss Sayaka has appeared in person.

03:33.875 --> 03:35.675
Has that day finally come?

03:35.975 --> 03:37.465
"That day"?

03:38.545 --> 03:42.815
I hope that today, someone ex citing
will finally appear before me.

03:50.395 --> 03:51.325
Oops!

03:51.325 --> 03:52.555
Sorry 'bout that.

03:52.895 --> 03:54.225
I'm in a hurry!

03:59.435 --> 04:02.405
He saw me, he touched me...

04:02.405 --> 04:05.675
...yet he left without showing
a bit of interest in me.

04:05.675 --> 04:07.575
I've never experienced this before.

04:12.115 --> 04:13.875
This way, Chibisuke!

04:14.855 --> 04:16.685
Listen, Chibisuke!

04:17.055 --> 04:19.915
Get it as soon as it pops its head
around that corner, okay?!

04:21.195 --> 04:22.315
It's here!

04:24.355 --> 04:25.395
Okay!

04:25.395 --> 04:27.955
Let 'em have it, Chibi!

04:35.035 --> 04:37.035
What an amazing way to get beaten!

04:37.035 --> 04:39.945
And it's a landmark image,
marking your thirtieth straight loss!

04:39.945 --> 04:41.315
Shut up!

04:41.315 --> 04:43.015
You don't hafta laugh so hard!

04:43.015 --> 04:44.175
Can't help it!

04:44.175 --> 04:47.915
There just hasn't been anyone like you
in the world of Dragon Drive until now!

04:49.355 --> 04:51.655
- R-Really?
- That wasn't a compliment!

04:51.655 --> 04:53.985
Actually, that wasn't all bad.

04:54.255 --> 04:55.895
Kyoji.

04:55.895 --> 04:59.125
I also had a good look at
your thirtieth straight loss.

05:00.265 --> 05:02.965
It's not easy to lose the way you did.

05:02.965 --> 05:04.795
Y-You making fun of me?

05:04.935 --> 05:06.765
The exact opposite.

05:06.765 --> 05:08.075
I'm thanking you.

05:08.075 --> 05:10.035
Looks like I won't be bored for a change.

05:11.005 --> 05:12.905
Won't you participate in today's match?

05:12.905 --> 05:13.775
Today's?

05:13.775 --> 05:15.975
There's no way Reiji can participate!

05:15.975 --> 05:17.705
Today's the Super Champion Tournament!

05:17.945 --> 05:20.005
Huh? Wh-What's that?

05:20.185 --> 05:23.345
It's just so boring,
without any element of surprise.

05:25.855 --> 05:27.425
What is it with him?

05:27.425 --> 05:30.445
What is this
"Super Champion Tournament"?

05:30.695 --> 05:32.795
It has nothing to do with you!

05:32.795 --> 05:35.695
But more importantly, we're gonna watch
your thirtieth straight loss again!

05:36.335 --> 05:37.735
Hey! W-Wait a minute!

05:39.505 --> 05:41.805
Why do you hafta show all my bad moves?!

05:41.805 --> 05:44.175
Because you have nothing but bad moves.

05:44.175 --> 05:46.535
I can't get excited
unless I face stronger opponents!

05:47.175 --> 05:49.145
You don't get it, do you, Reiji?!

05:49.915 --> 05:52.385
What you need to do is review
images from your losses...

05:52.385 --> 05:54.915
...and learn where you went wrong!

05:54.915 --> 05:56.615
Compare your skills with those of others...

05:56.615 --> 05:58.585
...and steal the techniques
of the best players.

05:58.885 --> 06:00.825
Don't you agree that this is important?

06:02.155 --> 06:05.125
Hey, why can't you be a good boy
and agree to what she says?

06:05.125 --> 06:07.325
You're not worthy of her words of wisdom!

06:07.665 --> 06:09.435
Ah... Well... Maybe you're right.

06:09.435 --> 06:10.535
I am right!

06:10.535 --> 06:12.435
So you just stay there and study!

06:12.435 --> 06:14.065
I'll go and buy you something to drink!

06:14.735 --> 06:16.575
She's right! Study hard!

06:16.575 --> 06:19.035
Oh, wait, my sweet honey!

06:19.905 --> 06:21.935
Study, huh?

06:24.785 --> 06:25.915
- Excuse...
- Oops.

06:25.915 --> 06:27.675
Eww, Ichiro again?!

06:28.085 --> 06:29.885
That's your greeting after plowing into me?

06:29.885 --> 06:31.015
Sorry.

06:31.825 --> 06:35.025
She's got a bad attitude.
Well, not that it matters to me.

06:35.025 --> 06:36.685
Super Champion Tournament
Power comparison
* Hikaru Himuro / A Kyoji Tachibana
B Ichiro Sumishiba / C Sayaka Towa

06:41.535 --> 06:42.515
This person...

06:43.295 --> 06:45.565
...looks like he isn't just some fool.

06:49.205 --> 06:50.235
Darn.

06:50.235 --> 06:53.505
Watching matches where I lost
is only gonna make me frustrated!

06:53.675 --> 06:55.975
I wanna watch great plays
by others even less.

06:56.175 --> 06:57.835
If I'm gonna watch something...

07:00.445 --> 07:01.915
Go!

07:03.985 --> 07:06.015
I'm so awesome!

07:06.885 --> 07:08.515
Right there! Chibi!

07:25.375 --> 07:27.235
Who are you?

07:27.545 --> 07:28.815
Oh, I know!

07:28.815 --> 07:31.685
You're deeply moved by watching
my great plays, right?!

07:31.685 --> 07:33.585
Yeah?! Hey, you!

07:35.515 --> 07:37.615
Wh-What's wrong with you?!

07:37.615 --> 07:38.725
You're acting creepy!

07:38.725 --> 07:40.025
Stop it, Reiji!

07:40.025 --> 07:41.525
Wh-What is it?!

07:41.525 --> 07:43.755
Don't you know who he is?!

07:43.755 --> 07:46.295
H-He's the top ranked Dragon Drive player.

07:46.295 --> 07:49.055
The reigning Super Champion,
Hikaru Himuro, in person!

07:50.365 --> 07:51.495
He's...

07:52.005 --> 07:53.595
...Hikaru Himuro?

07:54.465 --> 07:55.905
I get it!

07:55.905 --> 07:59.395
So someone that great
wants to challenge me to a match!

08:00.605 --> 08:02.115
Have you got any brains?!

08:02.115 --> 08:03.705
You're too close to her!

08:09.455 --> 08:11.645
You're Reiji Ozora, right?

08:13.185 --> 08:15.625
Th-That's me. And who might you be?

08:15.625 --> 08:19.925
My name is Sayaka Towa.

08:19.925 --> 08:21.585
It's a pleasure to meet you.

08:21.965 --> 08:23.565
P-Pleasure to meet me?

08:23.565 --> 08:24.765
So you're saying...

08:24.765 --> 08:28.495
Please accept this as a token
of our brand new friendship.

08:28.835 --> 08:29.235
Sayaka Towa

08:29.235 --> 08:33.405
Sayaka Towa
It's my card,
which I very rarely give out.

08:33.775 --> 08:36.215
As a special favor, I will give it to you only.

08:36.215 --> 08:37.905
Huh? Why just me?

08:38.045 --> 08:39.085
Hello!

08:39.085 --> 08:42.815
Doing that in the middle of a corridor
is really weird, and a nuisance to others!

08:42.985 --> 08:44.975
Oh, my. Excuse me.

08:47.755 --> 08:49.955
You two, will you break it up?!

08:51.155 --> 08:53.265
You're jealous. How cute.

08:53.265 --> 08:54.625
H-How dare you?

08:56.165 --> 08:57.865
What's it to you, anyway?!

08:57.865 --> 08:59.835
Don't be pushy, just 'cause you're champion!

09:01.005 --> 09:02.605
Is she a champion as well?

09:02.605 --> 09:05.575
Yes, she's Sayaka Towa,
the champion of C-Block.

09:06.245 --> 09:08.715
She's wealthy, so everyone fawns over her.

09:08.715 --> 09:10.375
I knew it!

09:10.775 --> 09:14.685
She also sensed my abilities,
and came to challenge me to a match!

09:14.955 --> 09:16.855
H-Hey, are you sure about that?!

09:17.755 --> 09:19.955
She just whispered it in my ear!

09:19.955 --> 09:23.925
"I want to get passionately physical
with you in D-Z one, just the two of us."

09:23.925 --> 09:25.165
Okay!

09:25.165 --> 09:27.355
- I'll teach him a lesson!
- Calm down.

09:27.525 --> 09:29.295
Thank you, Miss Sayaka!

09:29.295 --> 09:32.165
Thanks to you, I'm able
to touch Maiko Yukino.

09:32.165 --> 09:33.795
If you and Reiji get along...

09:34.305 --> 09:36.675
...my sweet honey will be mine.

09:36.675 --> 09:39.405
Okay! Look forward
to the next match, Chibisuke.

09:39.405 --> 09:40.145
We'll show them!

09:40.145 --> 09:41.605
Hey. Get your hands off of me, already!

09:42.475 --> 09:44.065
I could use this.

09:46.585 --> 09:48.985
What are you all upset about, Maiko?

09:49.455 --> 09:52.025
I simply told you what she told me!

09:52.025 --> 09:53.025
You're right!

09:53.025 --> 09:56.495
You simply acted like a lovesick puppy,
after being hit on by that vamp.

09:56.495 --> 10:00.825
Don't be jealous just because
the champion recognized my abilities!

10:01.165 --> 10:02.465
What did you say?!

10:02.465 --> 10:05.165
- Say it one more time!
- I'm telling ya, don't get so close!

10:05.165 --> 10:06.435
Hi, everyone!

10:06.435 --> 10:07.765
It's the moment you've been waiting for!

10:07.765 --> 10:10.205
The Super Champion Tournament
is about to begin!

10:10.705 --> 10:13.005
Hurry over to the stands!

10:14.405 --> 10:16.575
Okay! I'm on my way!

10:16.575 --> 10:18.545
- Hey! Wait a minute!
- Wait!

10:25.485 --> 10:27.925
We're beginning our special match!

10:28.425 --> 10:31.895
The Super Champion, currently on
a 1273-match winning streak...

10:31.895 --> 10:35.725
...faces champions of Blocks A, B,
and C in a battle royale-style match!

10:36.835 --> 10:38.825
Let me introduce you to the players.

10:39.005 --> 10:40.725
First, our champion...

10:40.865 --> 10:42.095
Mr. Hikaru Himuro.

10:45.105 --> 10:48.075
Our A-Block Champion,
Mr. Kyoji Tachibana!

10:49.515 --> 10:52.305
Our B-Block Champion,
Mr. Ichiro Sumishiba!

10:53.815 --> 10:56.285
And our C-Block Champion...

10:56.655 --> 10:58.885
The lone female player, Miss Sayaka Towa!

11:02.725 --> 11:04.655
Oh, my! There must be some mistake.

11:04.655 --> 11:06.625
I see five machines on the floor.

11:07.225 --> 11:10.825
Can one of our four champions
recommend an additional player?

11:12.205 --> 11:14.435
There can't possibly be anyone!

11:14.565 --> 11:17.535
Hikaru Himuro defeats all opponents within
five seconds of the start of the game.

11:17.535 --> 11:19.475
No one can compete against him.

11:19.475 --> 11:20.705
You're kidding! Really?

11:21.145 --> 11:22.135
Yes!

11:22.675 --> 11:25.045
I'd like to recommend Reiji Ozora.

11:25.415 --> 11:27.545
Huh? I can enter this match?

11:27.545 --> 11:28.715
Come on, Reiji!

11:28.715 --> 11:30.445
You don't have a chance!

11:30.715 --> 11:33.155
How do you know unless you try?

11:33.155 --> 11:34.155
Yes! Yes!

11:34.155 --> 11:36.125
I'll do it!

11:36.525 --> 11:39.255
Additional entry, Reiji Ozora!

11:40.165 --> 11:42.565
- Honestly!
- Is he serious?

11:43.135 --> 11:46.255
Okay players, secure your helmets.

11:46.505 --> 11:47.565
Yeah!

11:47.565 --> 11:49.165
I'm gonna do it!

11:51.075 --> 11:53.665
Mr. Himuro, I look forward
to an enjoyable match.

11:56.115 --> 11:58.175
I'll crush them in ten minutes.

11:59.515 --> 12:02.275
The logical order would start
with defeating Ichiro.

12:03.415 --> 12:05.405
We'll now begin the match!

12:05.655 --> 12:07.345
D-Break!

12:32.215 --> 12:33.845
Where am I?

12:41.485 --> 12:42.895
That was close.

12:42.895 --> 12:44.155
Reiji!

12:47.225 --> 12:48.735
Reiji!

12:48.735 --> 12:49.395
Sayaka!

12:49.395 --> 12:51.595
Please catch me!

13:04.375 --> 13:05.645
A-A-A-Are you okay?!

13:05.815 --> 13:08.145
Yes! I'm safe, thanks to you!

13:09.215 --> 13:12.185
Th-That's really great, but, uhh...

13:13.585 --> 13:15.325
Then let's get going!

13:15.325 --> 13:17.085
Get going? Where?

13:32.175 --> 13:33.975
Come on. There's no reason to be shy!

13:37.415 --> 13:39.675
All you need to do is keep your eyes on me.

13:48.325 --> 13:50.155
Hey! Reiji!

13:50.155 --> 13:52.595
Stop acting all lovesick and dopey!

13:53.765 --> 13:55.385
Now, now, just calm down.

13:55.965 --> 13:59.295
Miss Sayaka, please continue
what you're doing!

13:59.665 --> 14:01.165
U-Um, can I ask you something?

14:01.165 --> 14:02.405
What is it?

14:02.405 --> 14:04.265
This dragon doesn't look too strong.

14:04.705 --> 14:06.445
- Is it going to be okay?
- Yes.

14:06.445 --> 14:08.605
Its attacking power is only rated at 2.

14:09.775 --> 14:11.505
Even Chibi is at least 3.

14:12.485 --> 14:14.915
How in the world did you win
enough matches to become champion?

14:16.415 --> 14:18.575
You really don't know much, do you?

14:18.925 --> 14:20.645
Just watch, and you'll understand.

14:22.125 --> 14:23.055
Look!

14:26.965 --> 14:27.625
Oh!

14:27.625 --> 14:29.115
It's Mr. Hikaru Himuro.

14:29.735 --> 14:31.725
The stronger the opponent, the better.

14:32.565 --> 14:33.625
Floralfoehn!

14:48.815 --> 14:50.015
W-Wow!

14:50.785 --> 14:53.915
That's good! Wring it to death!

14:56.095 --> 14:57.145
Unbelievable!

14:57.595 --> 14:59.665
I thought this dragon was weak!

14:59.665 --> 15:01.455
It is, in terms of attacking power.

15:01.525 --> 15:02.865
But that...

15:03.395 --> 15:06.455
Yes, that is a nightmare
released by Floralfoehn.

15:07.605 --> 15:09.575
It's an illusion produced by the mist.

15:10.305 --> 15:12.205
It's an illusion so close to reality...

15:12.205 --> 15:15.835
...that one can actually feel pain
and experience the fear of dying.

15:16.545 --> 15:19.445
An illusion that makes you
experience the fear of dying.

15:19.885 --> 15:24.115
Even the mighty Mr. Hikaru Himuro
cannot escape this.

15:24.415 --> 15:29.795
And as fear eventually takes over the soul,
leaving the opponent helpless...

15:29.795 --> 15:35.425
...Floralfoehn focuses its attacking power,
precisely hitting the enemy's weakest point.

15:36.635 --> 15:40.825
So that's why you're a champion, even if
your dragon has an attacking power of 2.

15:42.275 --> 15:45.435
Please stand back and
observe my moment of victory.

15:49.245 --> 15:50.645
This should finish you off!

15:50.645 --> 15:51.945
It won't!

15:54.485 --> 15:55.575
A barrier, Chibi!

16:02.625 --> 16:03.615
Sayaka!

16:11.135 --> 16:12.925
Miss Towa, game over.

16:15.035 --> 16:17.765
The play of a true champion,
Mr. Hikaru Himuro.

16:18.375 --> 16:20.505
He used my nightmare mist against me.

16:21.675 --> 16:24.875
But what's also amazing
is that Reiji Ozora realized that.

16:25.445 --> 16:28.275
Well, it's no fluke
that I saw something about him.

16:32.525 --> 16:33.425
Hey!

16:33.425 --> 16:35.325
Are you saying I'm not even worth fighting?

16:37.995 --> 16:39.295
Darn that Hikaru.

16:39.295 --> 16:40.925
Let's go, Chibisuke!

16:47.765 --> 16:49.635
Where'd he go?

16:50.675 --> 16:51.865
Junrah-anshi!

16:54.275 --> 16:55.705
Uh-oh.

16:59.215 --> 17:02.815
That's Junrah-anshi, so it must be
Ichiro Sumishiba fighting.

17:02.815 --> 17:05.655
Looks like he's done a considerable
bit of research about Hikaru.

17:07.325 --> 17:09.445
Kyoji Tachibana.

17:10.155 --> 17:12.125
Why don't we observe their battle?

17:13.125 --> 17:15.325
But don't be surprised if this ends quickly.

17:17.695 --> 17:19.165
He's on the defensive!

17:19.165 --> 17:21.655
The Ichiro is completely on the defensive!

17:29.875 --> 17:30.705
Ichiro!

17:31.845 --> 17:33.215
Ichiro! Are you all right?!

17:33.885 --> 17:35.435
Hi, consecutive losses champ.

17:35.715 --> 17:39.815
If you don't wanna add to your record,
you'd better not move from there.

17:40.025 --> 17:41.115
Wh-What?!

17:41.885 --> 17:45.125
I've continued playing this game
for one reason only: to beat him!

17:45.865 --> 17:48.955
Today, I will finally force him
to acknowledge my presence!

17:49.195 --> 17:52.255
I'd like to have the chance
to fight against Hikaru, too!

17:52.435 --> 17:55.065
Not only are you a fool, you also
don't know your place in the pecking order!

17:55.065 --> 17:56.935
But you lost to me once!

17:59.505 --> 18:00.945
You don't get it, do you?

18:00.945 --> 18:03.545
I wasn't serious in my battle against you.

18:03.545 --> 18:04.575
What?!

18:04.575 --> 18:08.845
A master uses his trump card only against
the opponent that he really wants to beat!

18:12.785 --> 18:14.555
Th-There are more dragons!

18:16.155 --> 18:18.285
There, Himuro! Still think you can win?!

18:26.735 --> 18:27.535
You're kidding!

18:28.875 --> 18:31.075
Three in an instant.

18:31.075 --> 18:32.635
Got him.

18:33.545 --> 18:34.765
An ambush!

18:36.645 --> 18:38.835
Hikaru Himuro has been defeated.

18:39.245 --> 18:40.445
I can't believe it.

18:40.445 --> 18:44.215
The number one player is the player
who can read two steps ahead.

18:44.985 --> 18:46.245
I hope you're right.

18:48.255 --> 18:49.195
Not yet!

18:49.195 --> 18:50.855
Run for it, Ichiro!

18:50.855 --> 18:51.725
What?!

18:53.995 --> 18:54.925
Impossible!

18:57.265 --> 18:59.165
Go! Airblast!

19:04.635 --> 19:06.695
He was behind all along.

19:07.075 --> 19:10.705
I was fighting against a virtual image
he had created, all this time?

19:11.215 --> 19:12.575
The guy's truly amazing!

19:18.055 --> 19:20.815
Mr. Sumishiba and Mr. Tachibana,
game over.

19:21.085 --> 19:22.855
Reiji Ozora.

19:22.855 --> 19:26.315
Was he able to see Hikaru's attack?

19:27.765 --> 19:29.665
He's not the Super Champion for nothing.

19:29.995 --> 19:31.365
He's the real thing.

19:32.335 --> 19:33.535
Incredible.

19:33.535 --> 19:34.735
That's incredible!

19:34.735 --> 19:38.835
Hikaru, Ichiro, and Kyoji all truly control
their respective dragons!

19:43.815 --> 19:44.845
Huh?

19:44.845 --> 19:46.645
I can't move.

19:48.385 --> 19:50.815
I-I'd better hurry and give Chibi orders.

19:51.455 --> 19:53.885
Darn it, what am I so scared about?

19:57.025 --> 19:58.355
Chibisuke.

19:59.025 --> 20:00.295
I'm sorry.

20:00.295 --> 20:05.425
Because I'm absolutely useless, like now,
I'm not able to make you any stronger.

20:06.035 --> 20:08.665
I rely on your powers when it's convenient.

20:09.105 --> 20:12.935
If only I could work with you the way
Ichiro and Kyoji work with their dragons.

20:13.875 --> 20:15.545
If only I had studied...

20:15.545 --> 20:17.175
...just like Maiko told me to.

20:18.615 --> 20:19.885
But I...

20:19.885 --> 20:21.645
...I wanna battle the way they did, too!

20:22.355 --> 20:25.445
I'm lucky enough to play in the same field
as those other great players.

20:27.555 --> 20:29.355
Yet I can't do a damn thing!

20:42.875 --> 20:45.305
I won't lose, no matter what!

20:45.645 --> 20:46.605
Hikaru Himuro!

20:54.645 --> 20:55.985
Great Elder!

20:57.355 --> 20:59.315
Our true savior.

20:59.685 --> 21:02.015
Come to us quickly.

21:21.575 --> 21:23.045
Reiji Ozora.

21:24.915 --> 21:26.245
Well, Control Room?

21:26.545 --> 21:28.845
We've lost almost all of today's data!

21:29.255 --> 21:30.235
I see.

21:31.255 --> 21:34.015
What in the world happened in D-Z one?

21:56.915 --> 21:59.645
taikutsu datta
I was bored

21:59.645 --> 22:02.415
okubyou datta
I was a coward

22:02.415 --> 22:06.375
dareka wo jibun wo kizutsukete ita
I was hurting someone and myself

22:07.825 --> 22:10.595
tsuyogari itte
I tried to hide my weakness

22:10.595 --> 22:12.785
wagamama itte
I was being selfish

22:13.225 --> 22:17.355
doushiyoumonai kimochi mamoritsuzukete
Protecting the uncontrollable feeling

22:18.765 --> 22:21.435
otona ni natte
I became an adult

22:21.435 --> 22:24.175
kimi to deatte
Then I met you

22:24.175 --> 22:28.165
mune no sumikko yawarakaku natte
My heart got softened

22:29.475 --> 22:31.975
setsunaku natta
Longing for love

22:31.975 --> 22:34.985
dakishime atta
We embraced each other

22:34.985 --> 22:39.885
hakkiri mamorubeki mono wo mitsuketa
I finally knew what I wanted to protect

22:40.525 --> 22:43.255
tatta hitotsu no yuuki ga
Only one courage

22:43.255 --> 22:46.025
tatta hitotsu no kotoba ga
Just one word

22:46.025 --> 22:50.695
futari owaranai yume e to hakobu
Take us to an endless dream

22:51.395 --> 22:54.165
hon no chiisana yasashisa ga
Only a small kindness

22:54.165 --> 22:56.835
hon no wazuka na sasayaki ga
Only a small whisper

22:56.835 --> 23:01.505
futari wo sotto tsutsunde kureru
Wrap us gently

23:02.145 --> 23:06.675
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:07.585 --> 23:13.285
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:15.525 --> 23:18.285
Next episode

23:18.325 --> 23:19.865
Wow, that was some match.

23:19.865 --> 23:22.365
I made that Hikaru Himuro stagger!

23:22.365 --> 23:24.225
I might really be a genius!

23:25.595 --> 23:27.695
What? Don't be so confident?

23:27.865 --> 23:29.805
I have a fearful trial ahead of me?

23:31.075 --> 23:31.835
What?

23:31.835 --> 23:34.745
Hellish sessions in the
Special Training Room?!

23:35.205 --> 23:37.675
Next on Dragon Drive,
Rikyu, the Other Earth.

23:38.075 --> 23:39.785
Everybody, the wait is over!

23:39.785 --> 23:43.215
The time has come for you to see
Chibisuke's true appearance!

23:43.885 --> 23:45.315
Rikyu, the Other Earth
